<title>UK: CRICKET-RESULTS OF ASHES TESTS AT LORD'S.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RESULTS OF ASHES TESTS AT LORD'S.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Ashes tests at Lord's:</p>
<p>1884 - England won by an innings and five runs.</p>
<p>1886 - England won by an innings and 106 runs.</p>
<p>1888 - Australia won by 61 runs.</p>
<p>1890 - England won by seven wickets.</p>
<p>1893 - Draw.</p>
<p>1896 - England won by six wickets.</p>
<p>1899 - Australia won by 10 wickets.</p>
<p>1902 - Draw.</p>
<p>1905 - Draw.</p>
<p>1909 - Australia won by nine wickets.</p>
<p>1912 - Draw.</p>
<p>1921 - Australia won by eight wickets.</p>
<p>1926 - Draw.</p>
<p>1930 - Australia won by seven wickets.</p>
<p>1934 - England won by an innings and 38 runs.</p>
<p>1938 - Draw.</p>
<p>1948 - Australia won by 409 runs.</p>
<p>1953 - Draw.</p>
<p>1956 - Australia won by 185 runs.</p>
<p>1961 - Australia won by five wickets.</p>
<p>1964 - Draw.</p>
<p>1968 - Draw.</p>
<p>1972 - Australia won by eight wickets.</p>
<p>1975 - Draw.</p>
<p>1977 - Draw.</p>
<p>1981 - Draw.</p>
<p>1985 - Australia won by four wickets.</p>
<p>1989 - Australia won by six wickets.</p>
<p>1993 - Australia won by an innings and 62 runs.</p>
</text>
